            <abstract>
                <p>
                    The homily is divided into two parts, which form two readings in the weekly arrangement of the <foreign xml:lang="gez">Dǝrsāna Gabrǝʾel</foreign> 
                    (cf. <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BAVet82">Vatican City, Biblioteca Apostolica Vaticana, Aeth. 82</ref>). The first part is to be read on Wednesday, the second part is to be read on Friday.
                </p>
            </abstract>
        <calendarDesc><calendar xml:id="world"><p>ʿĀmata ʿālam/ʿĀmata ʾəm-fəṭrat (Era of the World)</p></calendar><calendar xml:id="ethiopian"><p> ʿĀmata śəggāwe (Era of the Incarnation –
