        <body>
            <div type="edition" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="div1LIT7740HomilyGab">  
                <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="First">
                    <label xml:lang="en">
                        Anonymous homily on the Archangel Gabriel, to be read on Wednesday
                    </label>
                    <note>The following incipit and explicit are taken from <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BAVet82">Vatican City, Biblioteca Apostolica Vaticana, Aeth. 82</ref>, quoted according to
                        the catalogue description in <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/QZH8VYBF"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/><title level="m">Bybliothecae apostolicae Vaticanae codices manu scripti recensiti iussu Pii XI Pontificis maximi. Codices Aethiopici Vaticani et Borgiani, Barberinianus orientalis 2, Rossianus 865&lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;, I:&lt;/hi&gt; Enarratio codicum</title><author><forename>Sylvain</forename><surname>Grébaut</surname></author><author><forename>Eugène</forename><surname>Tisserant</surname></author><pubPlace>Città del Vaticano</pubPlace><publisher>In Bybliotheca Vaticana</publisher><date>1935</date><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:GrebTiss1935Codices</note></note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:GrebTiss1935Codices</note><citedRange unit="page">309-310</citedRange></bibl>.</note>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="title" xml:lang="gez">
                        <ab> 
                            በስመ፡ አብ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/> ወሶበ፡ ይብል፡ ከመዝ፡ ውእቱ፡ ጊዜ፡ መጽአ፡ ኀቤሁ፡ መልአከ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ገብርኤል፡ ዜናዊ፨
                        </ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="explicit" xml:lang="gez">
                        <ab> 
                            ንሕነ፡ ሀሎነ፡ ዮም፡ ተጋቢአነ፡ ንግበር፡ በዓለ፡ ሎቱ፤ ያስምዕክሙ፡ ቃለ፡ ፍሥሐ፡ ዘይብል፨ ንዑ፡ ኀቤየ፡ ቡሩካነ፡ ለአቡየ፡ ትረሱ፡ መንግሥተ፡ ሰማያት፡ ዘድልቅ፡
                            ለክሙ፡ እምቅድመ፡ ይትፈጠር፡ ዓለም፨  ዘዓይን፡ ኢርእየ፡ ወእዝን፡ ኢሰም<supplied reason="omitted">ዐ</supplied>፡ ውስተ፡ ልበ፡ ሰብእ፡ ዘኢተሀለየ፡
                            ዘአስተዳለወ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ለእለ፡ ያፈቅርዎ፨ በትንብልናሃ፡ ለእግዝእተ፡ ኵልነ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/>
                        </ab>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div type="textpart" subtype="chapter" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="Second">
                    <label xml:lang="en">
                        Continuation of the anonymous homily on the Archangel Gabriel, to be read on Friday
                    </label>
                    <note>The following incipit and explicit are taken from <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BAVet82">Vatican City, Biblioteca Apostolica Vaticana, Aeth. 82</ref>, quoted according to
                        the catalogue description in <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/QZH8VYBF"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/><title level="m">Bybliothecae apostolicae Vaticanae codices manu scripti recensiti iussu Pii XI Pontificis maximi. Codices Aethiopici Vaticani et Borgiani, Barberinianus orientalis 2, Rossianus 865&lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;, I:&lt;/hi&gt; Enarratio codicum</title><author><forename>Sylvain</forename><surname>Grébaut</surname></author><author><forename>Eugène</forename><surname>Tisserant</surname></author><pubPlace>Città del Vaticano</pubPlace><publisher>In Bybliotheca Vaticana</publisher><date>1935</date><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:GrebTiss1935Codices</note></note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:GrebTiss1935Codices</note><citedRange unit="page">310</citedRange></bibl>.</note>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="title" xml:lang="gez">
                        <ab> 
                            ወካዕበ፡ ርኢኩ፡ ለኵሉ፡ አዕማድ፡ ኀበ፡ አቀምክዎሙ፡ ወውስተ፡ እዴሁ፡ ዘሀሎ፤ መስቀሎ፡
                        </ab>
                    </div>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="explicit" xml:lang="gez">
                        <ab> 
                            <sic>ወየዓትው፡</sic> አብያቲሆሙ፤ ሕያዋኒሆሙ፡ እንዘ፡ <sic>የአኵትዎ፡</sic> ለወልደ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ገባሬ፡ 
                            መንክራት፤ አሜሃ፡ ሰአሉ፡ ለሊቀ፡ መላእክት፡ ገብርኤል፡ ወወደይዎ፡ ውስተ፡ ቤተ፡ ክርስቲያኑ፡ ቅድስት፨ ለዓለመ፤ ዓለም፤ አሜን፨ 
                        </ab>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div type="bibliography">
                
            </div>
